<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56935" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέρχν-ος</span></b>  (B), ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rough excrescence</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τραχὺς χελώνης κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					279
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of the throat,
				<i>roughness, hoarseness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				7.27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> of sound,
				<i>harsh croaking</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ichn.</u>
				128
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>silverdust</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.99
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέρνος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.313.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				314.23
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Eleusis</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
